{"starts": [0.0, 7.333081999999999, 13.109039999999998, 18.718289, 24.995455, 30.960704, 35.103328, 45.067369], "total": 53.519743, "segs": [{"text": "¿Qué pasaría si caes de un avión sin paracaídas? Spoiler: podrías perder el conocimiento antes de llegar al suelo.", "words": [["Qué", 0.1, 0.290458], ["pasaría", 0.302375, 0.69525], ["si", 0.707125, 0.838083], ["caes", 0.85, 1.1], ["de", 1.111916, 1.195249], ["un", 1.207125, 1.302375], ["avión", 1.314291, 1.588082], ["sin", 1.6, 1.742875], ["paracaídas", 1.75475, 2.50475], ["Spoiler", 3.322625, 3.92975], ["podrías", 4.167875, 4.56075], ["perder", 4.572625, 4.858333], ["el", 4.87025, 4.941666], ["conocimiento", 4.953583, 5.524999], ["antes", 5.536916, 5.810707], ["de", 5.822625, 5.894041], ["llegar", 5.905958, 6.167874], ["al", 6.17975, 6.286875], ["suelo", 6.298791, 6.763082]], "dur": 7.1130819999999995}, {"text": "A diez kilómetros de altura, el aire es tan fino que te quedarías sin oxígeno en menos de un minuto.", "words": [["A", 0.098791, 0.253541], ["diez", 0.265458, 0.515458], ["kilómetros", 0.527375, 1.015458], ["de", 1.027375, 1.075], ["altura", 1.086916, 1.491666], ["el", 1.777375, 1.908333], ["aire", 1.92025, 2.134541], ["es", 2.146416, 2.253541], ["tan", 2.265458, 2.444041], ["fino", 2.455958, 2.705958], ["que", 2.717875, 2.836916], ["te", 2.848791, 2.944041], ["quedarías", 2.955958, 3.384541], ["sin", 3.396416, 3.551166], ["oxígeno", 3.563083, 4.051166], ["en", 4.063083, 4.170208], ["menos", 4.182125, 4.467833], ["de", 4.47975, 4.551166], ["un", 4.563083, 4.658333], ["minuto", 4.67025, 5.205958]], "dur": 5.5559579999999995}, {"text": "Además, haría unos cincuenta grados bajo cero, con un viento helado golpeándote sin parar.", "words": [["Además", 0.098791, 0.670207], ["haría", 0.932125, 1.170208], ["unos", 1.182125, 1.3845], ["cincuenta", 1.396416, 1.813082], ["grados", 1.825, 2.134541], ["bajo", 2.146416, 2.396416], ["cero", 2.408333, 2.717874], ["con", 2.944041, 3.086916], ["un", 3.098791, 3.194041], ["v